<title>FRANCE: Fr Telecom 96 net attrib profit 2.1 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Fr Telecom 96 net attrib profit 2.1 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable profit		    2.1  vs	     9.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit			    30.3  vs	    29.6</p>
<p>    Debt					    73.1  vs	    87.5</p>
<p>    Turnover					69.9  vs		85</p>
<p>NOTE - France Telecom SA gave its results in a statement. It said the net attributable profit includes exceptional elements and non-recurring charges and that stripping these out, the proforma net profit was 14.5 billion compared to 14 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>The government is privatising the telecommunications operator with an initial public offering of between 30-50 billion francs starting on May 6. Trading on the New York and Paris stock markets will start on June 9.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
